# .distignore — files/dirs to strip when building a release zip.
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Patterns match either a bare basename (e.g. `NOTES.md`) or a relative
# path from the plugin root (e.g. `docs/internal/`).
#
# Built-in framework excludes are always applied (VCS metadata, dev/,
# tests/, AI tool artifacts, composer/npm lockfiles, etc.) — you don't
# need to repeat them here. List project-specific extras only.

# Example project-specific excludes:
# docs/internal/
# scripts/dev-only/
# NOTES.md
